    "sub_name": "溝通說服與談判",
    "sub_ename": "NEGOTIATION STRATEGIES AND PERSUASION SKILLS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是讓學生了解溝通與說服及談判策略的理論與技巧，課程中將透過模擬情境練習與實務分享，培養學生分析思考與口語表達技巧，能有效應用相關理論與原則，建立未來在職場與生活中溝通與談判規劃的基礎能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will help the students to understand the relevant theory and skills of persuasion and negotiation. Students will be divided into groups to discuss questions about the practical scenarios. Student will learn intercultural communication strategies and skills through the experience, applying the competence in their future careers.",
